pan><span begin="00:38.940" end="00:39.720">privilege </span><span begin="00:39.720" end="00:39.840"> </span><span begin="00:39.840" end="00:40.050">could </span><span begin="00:40.050" end="00:40.500">feel </span><span begin="00:40.500" end="00:40.830">like </span><span begin="00:40.830" end="00:40.920">a </span><span begin="00:40.920" end="00:41.760">chore</span><span begin="00:41.760" end="00:42.030">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.030" end="00:47.160"><span begin="00:42.030" end="00:42.540">Maybe </span><span begin="00:42.540" end="00:42.840">it's </span><span begin="00:42.840" end="00:43.560">me </span><span begin="00:43.590" end="00:43.800">but </span><span begin="00:43.800" end="00:44.010">this </span><span begin="00:44.010" end="00:44.670">line </span><span begin="00:44.730" end="00:45.300">isn't </span><span begin="00:45.330" end="00:45.960">going </span><span begin="00:46.080" end="00:46.950">anywhere</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.160" end="00:50.280"><span begin="00:47.160" end="00:47.670">Maybe </span><span begin="00:47.670" end="00:47.790">if </span><span begin="00:47.790" end="00:47.970">we </span><span begin="00:47.970" end="00:48.360">looked </span><span begin="00:48.360" end="00:48.690">hard </span><span begin="00:48.690" end="00:49.290">enough</span><span begin="00:49.290" end="00:49.320">, </span><span begin="00:49.320" end="00:49.560">we </span><span begin="00:49.560" end="00:49.740">could </span><span begin="00:49.740" end="00:50.070">find </span><span begin="00:50.070" end="00:50.100">a </span><span begin="00:50.100" end="00:50.190">back </span><span begin="00:50.190" end="00:50.280">door</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.280" end="01:02.370"><span begin="00:50.280" end="00:50.610">Find </span><span begin="00:55.140" end="00:57.480">yourself </span><span begin="00:58.290" end="00:58.410">a </span><span begin="00:58.410" end="00:59.430">back </span><span begin="00:59.430" end="01:02.190">door</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.370" end="01:07.800"><span begin="01:02.370" end="01:02.490">I </span><span begin="01:02.490" end="01:03.240">see </span><span begin="01:03.240" end="01:03.720">you </span><span begin="01:03.720" end="01:04.230">in </span><span begin="01:04.230" end="01:05.160">line</span><span begin="01:05.160" end="01:05.190">, </span><span begin="01:05.190" end="01:06.150">dragging </span><span begin="01:06.150" end="01:06.840">your </span><span begin="01:06.840" end="01:07.650">feet</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.800" end="01:12.570"><span begin="01:07.800" end="01:08.160">You </span><span begin="01:08.160" end="01:08.730">have </span><span begin="01:08.730" end="01:09.600">my </span><span begin="01:09.600" end="01:12.540">sympathy</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.570" end="01:17.910"><span begin="01:12.570" end="01:12.900">The </span><span begin="01:12.900" end="01:13.560">day </span><span begin="01:13.560" end="01:13.890">you </span><span begin="01:13.890" end="01:14.490">were </span><span begin="01:14.520" end="01:15.510">born</span><span begin="01:15.510" end="01:15.540">, </span><span begin="01:15.540" end="01:15.840">you </span><span begin="01:15.840" end="01:16.410">were </span><span begin="01:16.410" end="01:17.040">born </span><span begin="01:17.040" end="01:17.730">free</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.910" end="01:28.170"><span begin="01:17.910" end="01:18.510">That </span><span begin="01:18.510" end="01:19.050">is </span><span begin="01:19.050" end="01:19.980">your </span><span begin="01:19.980" end="01:22.350">privilege</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.170" end="01:33.450"><span begin="01:28.170" end="01:28.800">Isn't </span><span begin="01:28.800" end="01:28.980">it </span><span begin="01:28.980" end="01:29.850">strange </span><span begin="01:29.850" end="01:30.150">that </span><span begin="01:30.150" end="01:30.330">the </span><span begin="01:30.330" end="01:30.690">man </span><span begin="01:30.690" end="01:31.32